<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Westvaco raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Westvaco raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch has raised its rating for Westvaco Corp to near-term accumulate from neutral, a source at the brokerage said on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Merrill kept its rating for Westvaco of long-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the company opened up 1/4 to 26-1/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
